				\begin{document}$${{{\rm{RMS}}}}{{{{\rm{E}}}}}_{{{{\rm{time}}}}}\left(n\right)$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="M4"><mml:mi mathvariant="normal">RMS</mml:mi><mml:msub><mml:mrow><mml:mi mathvariant="normal">E</mml:mi></mml:mrow><mml:mrow><mml:mi mathvariant="normal">time</mml:mi></mml:mrow></mml:msub><mml:mfenced close=")" open="("><mml:mrow><mml:mi>n</mml:mi></mml:mrow></mml:mfenced></mml:math><inline-graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="41467_2024_46361_Article_IEq2.gif"><?image-name 41467_2024_46361_Article_IEq2.gif?><?image-size 2770?><?image-md5 30e994af928860ede09c0056431fdfb2?><?image-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?image-scaled-height 40?><?image-scaled-width 200?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/b362/10923782/30e994af9288/41467_2024_46361_Article_IEq2.gif?><?thumb-name 41467_2024_46361_Article_IEq2.gif?><?thumb-size 2770?><?thumb-md5 30e994af928860ede09c0056431fdfb2?><?thumb-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?thumb-scaled-height 40?><?thumb-scaled-width 200?><?thumb-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/b362/10923782/30e994af9288/41467_2024_46361_Article_IEq2.gif?></inline-graphic></alternatives></inline-formula> for different lengths of past timeseries data. <bold>G</bold>
<inline-formula id="IEq3"><alternatives><tex-math id="M5"><?equation-image-name M5.gif?><?equation-image-status READY?><?equation-image-md5 782fbcd7f39d3eb5b679472401d524e4?><?equation-image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/b362/10923782/782fbcd7f39d/M5.gif?>\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
